[
    {
        "id": "cm-c",
        "type": "comment",
        "name": "Cache modes: wrapped vs flat, LRU, TTL",
        "info": "Click **send sensor/1..4** a few times, then click **show caches**.\n\n- **wrapped** (`demoWrapped`, TTL 30 s): stores `{payload, ts, metadata, previous}`. Entries older than 30 s are purged. Use this shape as the `dataops-claude` source.\n- **flat** (`demoFlat`, max 3 entries): stores the payload as-is. Writing a 4th topic evicts the least-recently written one. Use this shape for `dataops-runtime`.\n\nYou can also browse both under **Context → Global** in the sidebar.",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
